  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.6 (editor polish): each group renders as a real container (hairline border, rounded corners, the section name and its toolbar on a title row above the fields) instead of a bold heading followed by loose fields, so the area you drop into is now visible. Edit mode only; the rendered form is unchanged. Also fixes two tinted backgrounds (drag placeholder, field-preview box) that read a CSS variable MudBlazor does not define and were therefore transparent.",
